{
  "name": "SELinux Remediation Workflow",
  "description": "EDA -> AI triage -> switch (dev auto-patch / prod approval / investigate / fallback). Dev and prod share the commit -> sync -> dynamic JT -> observe chain; prod adds an AO approval gate. Investigate runs a second agent, a python parse script, and a notify JT. Expressions: ${trigger.payload.*}, agentic ${nTriage.result.content}, AAP ${nFetchDev.artifacts.*}.",
  "workflow_definition": {
    "schema_version": "2.0.0",
    "name": "SELinux Remediation Workflow",
    "description": "Switch-routed SELinux remediation: AI triage, env split, prod approval, investigate, fallback",
    "triggers": [
      {
        "id": "t1",
        "type": "eda_trigger",
        "name": "SELinux EDA Trigger",
        "parameters": {
          "webhook_path": "selinux",
          "authorized_service_account_ids": [
            "PLACEHOLDER_SA_ID"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "nTriage",
        "type": "agentic",
        "name": "AI Triage Agent",
        "parameters": {
          "prompt": "Triage SELinux AVC denials on RHEL (httpd, /srv/webapp/, permissive).\nHost: ${trigger.payload.host}\nEnvironment: ${trigger.payload.environment}\nForce route: ${trigger.payload.force_route}\nAVC count: ${trigger.payload.avc_count}\n\nAVC Denials:\n${trigger.payload.avc_denials}\n\naudit2allow:\n${trigger.payload.audit2allow_output}\n\nGroup duplicates. Prefer semanage fcontext over booleans/modules.\nChoose route:\n- auto_patch_dev: environment is dev AND findings have fcontext/boolean/port remediations\n- approval_required_prod: environment is prod AND remediations are known\n- investigate: no safe known remediation (empty findings, only module, or low confidence)\n- fallback: cannot classify\nIf force_route is one of those four values, use it as route.\n\nReturn ONLY raw JSON. No markdown fences. Start with { end with }.\nKeys: summary, findings[{denial,source_type,target_type,target_path,permission,recommendation,remediation{type,selinux_type,path_spec,boolean_name,boolean_value}}], audit2allow_assessment, route, confidence, rationale",
          "llm_model_id": "PLACEHOLDER_LLM_MODEL_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_LLM_CRED_ID",
          "tool_selection_strategy": "NONE",
          "responseSchema": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "summary",
              "findings",
              "audit2allow_assessment",
              "route",
              "confidence",
              "rationale"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "summary": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "audit2allow_assessment": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "route": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "confidence": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "rationale": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "findings": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": [
                    "denial",
                    "recommendation",
                    "remediation"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "denial": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "source_type": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "target_type": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "target_path": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "permission": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "recommendation": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "remediation": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "required": [
                        "type"
                      ],
                      "properties": {
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "selinux_type": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "path_spec": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "boolean_name": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "boolean_value": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nParse",
        "type": "script",
        "name": "Normalize Route",
        "parameters": {
          "language": "python",
          "environment": {
            "TRIAGE_JSON": "${nTriage.result.content}",
            "ENVIRONMENT": "${trigger.payload.environment}",
            "FORCE_ROUTE": "${trigger.payload.force_route}"
          },
          "code": "import json, os, re, sys\nraw = os.environ.get('TRIAGE_JSON') or '{}'\nraw = re.sub(r'^```(?:json)?\\s*|\\s*```$', '', raw.strip())\nraw = re.sub(r'^<string>\\s*|\\s*</string>$', '', raw.strip())\ntry:\n    data = json.loads(raw)\n    if not isinstance(data, dict):\n        data = {'summary': str(data), 'findings': []}\nexcept Exception as exc:\n    data = {'summary': 'unparseable triage', 'findings': [], 'parse_error': str(exc)}\nallowed = {'auto_patch_dev', 'approval_required_prod', 'investigate', 'fallback'}\nforce = (os.environ.get('FORCE_ROUTE') or '').strip()\nenv = (os.environ.get('ENVIRONMENT') or 'dev').strip().lower() or 'dev'\nroute = (data.get('route') or '').strip()\nif force in allowed:\n    route = force\nelif route not in allowed:\n    findings = data.get('findings') if isinstance(data.get('findings'), list) else []\n    known = False\n    for item in findings:\n        if not isinstance(item, dict):\n            continue\n        rtype = ((item.get('remediation') or {}) if isinstance(item.get('remediation'), dict) else {}).get('type')\n        if rtype in ('fcontext', 'boolean', 'port'):\n            known = True\n            break\n    if not findings:\n        route = 'fallback'\n    elif not known:\n        route = 'investigate'\n    elif env == 'prod':\n        route = 'approval_required_prod'\n    else:\n        route = 'auto_patch_dev'\ndata['route'] = route\ndata['environment'] = env\nprint(json.dumps(data, separators=(',', ':')))\n"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nSwitch",
        "type": "switch",
        "name": "Route Decision",
        "parameters": {
          "cases": [
            {
              "port": "auto_patch_dev",
              "label": "Auto-Patch (Dev)",
              "condition": "${nParse.result.route} == \"auto_patch_dev\""
            },
            {
              "port": "approval_required_prod",
              "label": "Approval Required (Prod)",
              "condition": "${nParse.result.route} == \"approval_required_prod\""
            },
            {
              "port": "investigate",
              "label": "Investigate",
              "condition": "${nParse.result.route} == \"investigate\""
            }
          ],
          "default_port": "fallback"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nFetchDev",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Commit Remediations (Dev)",
        "parameters": {
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "selinux_analysis_json": "${nTriage.result.content}",
            "vm_name": "${trigger.payload.host}",
            "environment": "dev"
          },
          "job_template_name": "SELinux - Commit Remediations",
          "organization_name": "Default"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nSyncDev",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Sync and Deploy (Dev)",
        "parameters": {
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "template_name": "${nFetchDev.artifacts.template_name}",
            "environment": "dev"
          },
          "job_template_name": "SELinux - Sync and Deploy",
          "organization_name": "Default"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nRemDev",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Run SELinux Remediation (Dev)",
        "parameters": {
          "job_template_name": "${nSyncDev.artifacts.template_name}",
          "organization_name": "Default",
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "trigger_payload": "${trigger.payload}",
            "selinux_analysis_json": "${nTriage.result.content}"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nObsDev",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Post-Remediation Observation (Dev)",
        "parameters": {
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "vm_name": "${trigger.payload.host}",
            "pre_avc_count": "${trigger.payload.avc_count}"
          },
          "job_template_name": "SELinux - Post-Remediation Observation",
          "organization_name": "Default"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nAppr",
        "type": "approval",
        "name": "Approve Production Patch",
        "parameters": {
          "prompt": "Approve production SELinux remediation for ${trigger.payload.host}? Review the triage JSON, then approve or reject.",
          "decision_window": 3600
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nFetchProd",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Commit Remediations (Prod)",
        "parameters": {
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "selinux_analysis_json": "${nTriage.result.content}",
            "vm_name": "${trigger.payload.host}",
            "environment": "prod"
          },
          "job_template_name": "SELinux - Commit Remediations",
          "organization_name": "Default"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nSyncProd",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Sync and Deploy (Prod)",
        "parameters": {
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "template_name": "${nFetchProd.artifacts.template_name}",
            "environment": "prod"
          },
          "job_template_name": "SELinux - Sync and Deploy",
          "organization_name": "Default"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nRemProd",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Run SELinux Remediation (Prod)",
        "parameters": {
          "job_template_name": "${nSyncProd.artifacts.template_name}",
          "organization_name": "Default",
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "trigger_payload": "${trigger.payload}",
            "selinux_analysis_json": "${nTriage.result.content}"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nObsProd",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Post-Remediation Observation (Prod)",
        "parameters": {
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "vm_name": "${trigger.payload.host}",
            "pre_avc_count": "${trigger.payload.avc_count}"
          },
          "job_template_name": "SELinux - Post-Remediation Observation",
          "organization_name": "Default"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nInv",
        "type": "agentic",
        "name": "Investigate - No Known Remediation",
        "parameters": {
          "prompt": "No safe auto-remediation was selected for this SELinux event. Investigate.\nHost: ${trigger.payload.host}\nEnvironment: ${trigger.payload.environment}\nTriage JSON:\n${nTriage.result.content}\n\nAVC Denials:\n${trigger.payload.avc_denials}\n\naudit2allow:\n${trigger.payload.audit2allow_output}\n\nExplain what is unknown, what a human should check (ausearch, sesearch, booleans, fcontext, custom policy), and the risk of guessing a module. Return ONLY raw JSON (no fences) with keys: headline, unknown_denials (array of strings), recommended_checks (array of strings), risk, next_action.",
          "llm_model_id": "PLACEHOLDER_LLM_MODEL_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_LLM_CRED_ID",
          "tool_selection_strategy": "NONE",
          "responseSchema": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "headline",
              "unknown_denials",
              "recommended_checks",
              "risk",
              "next_action"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "headline": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "unknown_denials": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "recommended_checks": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              },
              "risk": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "next_action": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nParseInv",
        "type": "script",
        "name": "Parse Investigation Result",
        "parameters": {
          "language": "python",
          "environment": {
            "INVESTIGATION_JSON": "${nInv.result.content}",
            "HOST": "${trigger.payload.host}"
          },
          "code": "import json, os, re\nraw = os.environ.get('INVESTIGATION_JSON') or '{}'\nraw = re.sub(r'^```(?:json)?\\s*|\\s*```$', '', raw.strip())\nraw = re.sub(r'^<string>\\s*|\\s*</string>$', '', raw.strip())\ntry:\n    data = json.loads(raw)\n    if not isinstance(data, dict):\n        data = {'headline': str(data)}\nexcept Exception as exc:\n    data = {'headline': 'unparseable investigation', 'parse_error': str(exc)}\nhost = os.environ.get('HOST') or 'unknown'\nheadline = data.get('headline') or 'SELinux investigation required'\nchecks = data.get('recommended_checks') if isinstance(data.get('recommended_checks'), list) else []\nbody = '\\n'.join(f'- {c}' for c in checks) or 'No checks listed.'\nout = {\n    'host': host,\n    'headline': headline,\n    'risk': data.get('risk') or 'unknown',\n    'next_action': data.get('next_action') or '',\n    'body': body,\n    'unknown_denials': data.get('unknown_denials') or [],\n}\nprint(json.dumps(out, separators=(',', ':')))\n"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nNotify",
        "type": "aap_job_template",
        "name": "Notify Investigation",
        "parameters": {
          "integration_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_INT_ID",
          "credential_id": "PLACEHOLDER_AAP_CRED_ID",
          "extra_vars": {
            "investigation_json": "${nInv.result.content}",
            "investigation_headline": "${nParseInv.result.headline}",
            "vm_name": "${trigger.payload.host}"
          },
          "job_template_name": "SELinux - Notify Investigation",
          "organization_name": "Default"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "nFall",
        "type": "script",
        "name": "Fallback",
        "parameters": {
          "language": "python",
          "environment": {
            "HOST": "${trigger.payload.host}",
            "ROUTE": "${nParse.result.route}"
          },
          "code": "import json, os\nprint(json.dumps({'status': 'fallback', 'host': os.environ.get('HOST'), 'route': os.environ.get('ROUTE'), 'message': 'No auto-patch, approval, or investigate path matched.'}, separators=(',', ':')))\n"
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "from": "t1",
        "to": "nTriage"
      },
      {
        "from": "nTriage",
        "to": "nParse"
      },
      {
        "from": "nParse",
        "to": "nSwitch"
      },
      {
        "from": "nSwitch",
        "to": "nFetchDev",
        "from_port": "auto_patch_dev"
      },
      {
        "from": "nFetchDev",
        "to": "nSyncDev"
      },
      {
        "from": "nSyncDev",
        "to": "nRemDev"
      },
      {
        "from": "nRemDev",
        "to": "nObsDev"
      },
      {
        "from": "nSwitch",
        "to": "nAppr",
        "from_port": "approval_required_prod"
      },
      {
        "from": "nAppr",
        "to": "nFetchProd",
        "from_port": "approved"
      },
      {
        "from": "nFetchProd",
        "to": "nSyncProd"
      },
      {
        "from": "nSyncProd",
        "to": "nRemProd"
      },
      {
        "from": "nRemProd",
        "to": "nObsProd"
      },
      {
        "from": "nSwitch",
        "to": "nInv",
        "from_port": "investigate"
      },
      {
        "from": "nInv",
        "to": "nParseInv"
      },
      {
        "from": "nParseInv",
        "to": "nNotify"
      },
      {
        "from": "nSwitch",
        "to": "nFall",
        "from_port": "fallback"
      }
    ]
  }
}
